TOLD ME I WAS TOO BIG.

672
00:25:55,452 --> 00:25:57,788
Jay: SO USE THE WHIP TO KIND
OF ANTAGONIZE THIS ONE.

673
00:25:57,788 --> 00:25:59,023
YEAH.

674
00:25:59,023 --> 00:26:01,592
FACE UP TO THE LIGHT
AND SHOW THE BUTT.

675
00:26:01,592 --> 00:26:03,427
Cassie: I DON'T REALLY
KNOW WHAT THIS IS,

676
00:26:03,427 --> 00:26:06,931
BUT I GUESS IT'S A GOOD OPPOSITE
OF BEING REALLY SWEET.

677
00:26:06,931 --> 00:26:09,133
Jay: AND REMEMBER--
AND SHOW DISGUST.

678
00:26:09,133 --> 00:26:11,602
Cassie: THERE'S JUST A LOT OF
THINGS GOING THROUGH MY HEAD.

679
00:26:11,602 --> 00:26:14,405
I'M CONCERNED ABOUT MY UNCLE
THAT MIGHT BE DYING,

680
00:26:14,405 --> 00:26:16,740
AND I HOPE IT DOESN'T
COME OUT IN MY PICTURES.

681
00:26:19,677 --> 00:26:21,478
Jay: TRY TO PUT YOUR HAND
THROUGH THEM

682
00:26:21,478 --> 00:26:23,380
SO IT'S LIKE, I MEAN,
DOING THIS, BUT WE'LL--

683
00:26:23,380 --> 00:26:25,716
WE'LL DIGITALLY DO IT SO IT'S
LIKE THE HAND IS GOING THROUGH.

684
00:26:25,716 --> 00:26:26,784
Davide: AND JUST LIKE...

685
00:26:26,784 --> 00:26:28,519
NICE. YES, YES, YES.

686
00:26:28,519 --> 00:26:29,753
PERFECT.

687
00:26:29,753 --> 00:26:31,422
Jay: YOU'RE REVEALING
YOURSELF TO HER FOR A REASON

688
00:26:31,422 --> 00:26:32,957
'CAUSE YOU ARE A GHOST.

689
00:26:32,957 --> 00:26:37,094
Yaya: THIS LOOK IS THAT
OF 17th CENTURY COURTESAN.

690
00:26:37,094 --> 00:26:38,729
Davide: YAYA,
AS A FIRST TIME,

691
00:26:38,729 --> 00:26:39,864
PERFECT
THE SECOND TIME, TOO.

692
00:26:39,864 --> 00:26:42,132
ALTER EGO.
IT WAS BRILLIANT.

693
00:26:44,034 --> 00:26:46,470
Jay: A LOT OF THE GIRLS ARE
PLAYING IT KIND OF SCARED.

694
00:26:46,470 --> 00:26:49,106
Amanda: LIKE,
ARE YOU GONNA HURT ME?

695
00:26:49,106 --> 00:26:50,875
Davide: WE'RE GONNA
HURT YOU. WE'LL HURT YOU.

696
00:26:50,875 --> 00:26:52,076
Jay: CAN YOU SEE
IF YOU'RE ALMOST--

697
00:26:52,076 --> 00:26:53,510
TRY AND CHEAT YOUR FACE
THAT WAY

698
00:26:53,510 --> 00:26:55,512
'CAUSE WE GOTTA SEE
ALL THAT AMAZING MAKEUP.

699
00:26:55,512 --> 00:26:56,947
YEAH, GREAT. THAT'S GREAT.

700
00:27:02,686 --> 00:27:03,787
Michele: WHAT SIZE
DID YOU TELL ME YOU WORE?

701
00:27:03,787 --> 00:27:05,522
A 12 OR IS IT REALLY A 14?

702
00:27:05,522 --> 00:27:07,591
Toccara: I LOOK LIKE
I WORK AT A BOWLING ALLEY.

703
00:27:07,591 --> 00:27:08,926
Michele:
NO, YOU DON'T.

704
00:27:08,926 --> 00:27:10,928
Toccara: I WANNA KNOW
WHY ALL THE GIRLS

705
00:27:10,928 --> 00:27:12,630
WERE SO NICE-LOOKIN',

706
00:27:12,630 --> 00:27:15,366
AND HERE I AM LOOKIN' LIKE
I WORK AT HOME DEPOT.

707
00:27:15,366 --> 00:27:16,901
Michele: YOU HAVE TO
UNDERSTAND, TOO, TOCCARA,

708
00:27:16,901 --> 00:27:18,836
IF YOU WERE TO DO CATALOGS,
YOU KNOW,

709
00:27:18,836 --> 00:27:20,337
FOR PLUS-SIZED MODELS
AND STUFF LIKE THAT--

710
00:27:20,337 --> 00:27:21,572
Toccara: I KNOW,
BUT THIS IS HIGH FASHION.

711
00:27:21,572 --> 00:27:22,706
THIS IS NOT CATALOG.

712
00:27:22,706 --> 00:27:25,576
I GOT TO PROVE MYSELF
TO THE HIGH FASHION PEOPLE.

713
00:27:25,576 --> 00:27:27,912
Michele: DO YOU THINK THAT
I'M GONNA BE ABLE TO GET

714
00:27:27,912 --> 00:27:31,515
A RACK LIKE THIS LOADED
WITH CLOTHES IN YOUR SIZE?

715
00:27:31,515 --> 00:27:33,384
Toccara: YOU CAN'T FIND
SOMETHING IN MY SIZE

716
00:27:33,384 --> 00:27:34,852
SO I'M SUPPOSED TO FEEL BAD
BECAUSE--

717
00:27:34,852 --> 00:27:36,453
YOU JUST SAID THAT.
YOU SAID I HAVE TO START--

718
00:27:36,453 --> 00:27:38,389
Michele: YOU'RE TAKING
EVERYTHING AS A NEGATIVE.

719
00:27:38,389 --> 00:27:39,123
I DON'T THINK
THAT YOU REALIZE

720
00:27:39,123 --> 00:27:41,058
HOW THIS WHOLE MODELING
THING WORKS.

721
00:27:41,058 --> 00:27:43,060
THERE'S, LIKE,
NO APPRECIATION.

722
00:27:43,060 --> 00:27:45,362
- Toccara: AAH! MY GOD!
- Michele: OH, SORRY.

723
00:27:45,362 --> 00:27:47,564
ALL RIGHT, YOU GOT PINCHED.
OH, MY GOD.

724
00:27:47,564 --> 00:27:48,866
Toccara:
I KNOW. OH, MY GOD.

725
00:27:48,866 --> 00:27:49,967
Michele: LET ME SEE.

726
00:27:49,967 --> 00:27:51,068
Jay: THAT WAS LOUD.

727
00:27:51,068 --> 00:27:52,036
Davide: OKAY.

728
00:27:54,571 --> 00:27:55,673
Jay: OTHER HAND, THOUGH.

729
00:27:55,673 --> 00:27:57,775
DAVIDE, LIKE,
SHE'S OPENING THE DOOR

730
00:27:57,775 --> 00:27:59,944
FOR THE GLAMOROUS ONE,
BECAUSE, LOOK AT HER.

731
00:27:59,944 --> 00:28:01,545
SHE'S THE PARKING ATTENDANT.

732
00:28:01,545 --> 00:28:03,013
I WANNA FEEL YOUR PAIN.

733
00:28:03,013 --> 00:28:04,782
I WANNA FEEL YOUR LONGING.

734
00:28:04,782 --> 00:28:06,917
I DO WANT IT TO READ
A LITTLE MORE IN YOUR EYES

735
00:28:06,917 --> 00:28:09,353
BECAUSE, HONESTLY,
YOUR WEAKEST POINT

736
00:28:09,353 --> 00:28:10,487
IN YOUR PHOTOS
ARE YOUR EYES.

737
00:28:11,989 --> 00:28:16,060
TOCCARA--TO TRY
AND LET DOWN THAT WALL

738
00:28:16,060 --> 00:28:17,494
IS GONNA BE HER BIGGEST
CHALLENGE,

739
00:28:17,494 --> 00:28:21,598
'CAUSE SHE'S AFRAID
TO ACT WITH HER EYES.

740
00:28:21,598 --> 00:28:24,335
Michele: MAYBE SOME TAPE.

741
00:28:24,335 --> 00:28:28,605
WE'RE GONNA HAVE TO REALLY
SEVERELY STRAP THEM DOWN.

742
00:28:28,605 --> 00:28:30,741
Toccara: I'VE BEEN
DISAPPOINTED WITH MYSELF.

743
00:28:30,741 --> 00:28:33,577
I ALLOWED OTHER PEOPLE
TO TAKE MY ENERGY,

744
00:28:33,577 --> 00:28:35,813
THAT THEY WOULD HAVE MADE ME
FEEL SO BAD AND ASHAMED.

745
00:28:35,813 --> 00:28:37,614
Jay: YOU'RE WORKIN'.

746
00:28:37,614 --> 00:28:40,951
UH, JIM, FOR POSITIONING,
JUST GIVE ME MY KEYS,

747
00:28:40,951 --> 00:28:43,420
AND CAN YOU GIVE ME A LITTLE...
(makes cracking sound)

748
00:28:43,420 --> 00:28:45,589
YEAH, IT'S THE CAMERA'S
POINT OF VIEW. THAT'S GREAT.

749
00:28:45,589 --> 00:28:47,391
CAN WE SEE THE SPACE
HERE, DAVIDE?

750
00:28:47,391 --> 00:28:48,659
- Davide: PERFECT.
- Jay: THANK YOU.

751
00:28:48,659 --> 00:28:49,760
Davide:
GOOD. STAY THERE.

752
00:28:49,760 --> 00:28:51,628
GOOD.

753
00:28:51,628 --> 00:28:53,397
Jay: YOU'VE GOT SUCH
A BEAUTIFUL FACE,

754
00:28:53,397 --> 00:28:55,632
BUT YOUR EYES--THEY'RE
A NICE, SULTRY, ALMOND LOOK,

755
00:28:55,632 --> 00:28:57,501
WHICH IS JUST, LIKE,
THIS SEXY LOOK,

756
00:28:57,501 --> 00:28:59,470
BUT OFTENTIMES
IT CAN READ DEAD.

757
00:29:01,138 --> 00:29:03,173
Toccara: I DON'T THINK
I DID A VERY GOOD JOB.

758
00:29:03,173 --> 00:29:04,641
I SHOULD HAVE KEPT
A POSITIVE ATTITUDE,

759
00:29:04,641 --> 00:29:06,877
LIKE, OKAY--I DON'T KNOW.

760
00:29:06,877 --> 00:29:08,379
I REALLY LET IT
GET TO ME.

761
00:29:19,056 --> 00:29:21,058
Yaya: EVEN THOUGH
THEY SAY THAT

762
00:29:21,058 --> 00:29:23,394
THEY WELCOME
PLUS-SIZED MODELS,

763
00:29:23,394 --> 00:29:25,729
YOU KNOW THAT THEY DON'T PAY
AS MUCH ATTENTION TO YOU,

764
00:29:25,729 --> 00:29:27,431
AND YOU'RE HANDLING
YOURSELF VERY WELL.

765
00:29:27,431 --> 00:29:28,599
YOU HAVE ONE THING.

766
00:29:28,599 --> 00:29:30,567
LET'S HOPE IT FITS,
AND THAT'S IT,

767
00:29:30,567 --> 00:29:31,869
SO YOU HAVE A RIGHT
TO BREAK DOWN.

768
00:29:31,869 --> 00:29:33,070
Toccara:
AND SHE SHOULDN'T MAKE ME

769
00:29:33,070 --> 00:29:34,705
FEEL LIKE THAT, YOU KNOW?

770
00:29:34,705 --> 00:29:36,407
NOW LOOK AT WHAT
EVERYBODY ELSE HAD ON,

771
00:29:36,407 --> 00:29:38,108
AND I KNOW I CAN'T
COMPARE MYSELF

772
00:29:38,108 --> 00:29:40,077
TO EVERYBODY ELSE,
BUT, DAMN--

773
00:29:40,077 --> 00:29:44,615
SLACKS
AND SKIRTS AND DRESSES.

774
00:29:44,615 --> 00:29:46,383
I THINK IT'S JUST HARD
BECAUSE I'M STANDING,

775
00:29:46,383 --> 00:29:48,385
JUST TRYING
TO BE SO GRATEFUL.

776
00:29:48,385 --> 00:29:50,487
IT JUST MAKES ME GRATEFUL,
BUT IT HURTS.

777
00:30:02,172 --> 00:30:03,873
Eva:
AND WE HAVE TYRA MAIL.

778
00:30:03,873 --> 00:30:05,608
WHERE IS AMANDA?

779
00:30:05,608 --> 00:30:07,777
"TOMORROW YOU WILL MEET
WITH THE JUDGES.

780
00:30:07,777 --> 00:30:09,112
ONLY SEVEN OF YOU
WILL CONTINUE

781
00:30:09,112 --> 00:30:11,481
IN HOPES OF BECOMING
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

782
00:30:11,481 --> 00:30:13,550
ONE OF YOU WILL BE
ELIMINATED."

783
00:30:13,550 --> 00:30:14,884
Nicole: THE STRESS
IS INTENSIFIED.

784
00:30:14,884 --> 00:30:18,488
THERE IS MORE OF A CHANCE THAT
I'M GOING HOME WITH EACH CUT.

785
00:30:18,488 --> 00:30:21,524
Amanda:
I LOVE PINK POSITIVE.

786
00:30:21,524 --> 00:30:23,493
Cassie: YOU NEVER KNOW
WHO'S GONNA GO,

787
00:30:23,493 --> 00:30:24,928
AND I'VE LEARNED
TO STOP GUESSING,

788
00:30:24,928 --> 00:30:26,829
BUT JUST FROM WHAT I SAW,

789
00:30:26,829 --> 00:30:28,731
I THINK TOCCARA
HAD A REALLY HARD TIME

790
00:30:28,731 --> 00:30:30,166
WITH THE BEAUTY SHOTS.

791
00:30:30,166 --> 00:30:33,102
Toccara: I GUESS IT REALLY
UPSET ME, THE PHOTO SHOOT,

792
00:30:33,102 --> 00:30:36,472
BECAUSE I'VE BEEN
DISAPPOINTED WITH MYSELF.

793
00:30:36,472 --> 00:30:40,109
Norelle: I'M STILL
EXTREMELY NERVOUS.

794
00:30:40,109 --> 00:30:43,112
THIS IS THE KIND OF FOOD
YOU EAT WHEN YOU'RE DEPRESSED.

795
00:30:43,112 --> 00:30:46,482
I'VE BEEN TRYING SO HARD
AND I'M SO PROUD OF MYSELF.

796
00:30:46,482 --> 00:30:47,817
NICE AND FATTENING.

797
00:30:47,817 --> 00:30:50,720
I'VE GONE THROUGH
SIX ELIMINATIONS

798
00:30:50,720 --> 00:30:52,488
NOT BEING THE STRONGEST GIRL,
AND I'M STILL HERE.

799
00:31:03,095 --> 00:31:06,337
Tyra: THE GROUP IS
GETTING SMALLER AND SMALLER.

800
00:31:06,337 --> 00:31:09,073
TODAY WE'RE GOING TO MAKE
OUR SEVENTH CUT,

801
00:31:09,073 --> 00:31:11,909
WHICH WILL BRING US
ONE STEP CLOSER TOWARDS

802
00:31:11,909 --> 00:31:15,012
DETERMINING WHO WILL BECOME
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

803
00:31:15,012 --> 00:31:17,114
WE HAVE SOME AMAZING PRIZES.

804
00:31:17,114 --> 00:31:19,383
YOU'LL RECEIVE
A MODELING CONTRACT

805
00:31:19,383 --> 00:31:23,521
WITH THE TOP INTERNATIONAL
MODELING AGENCY, FORD MODELS;

806
00:31:23,521 --> 00:31:25,422
A PHOTO SPREAD
IN "ELLE" MAGAZINE,

807
00:31:25,422 --> 00:31:26,590
WHICH WILL BE PHOTOGRAPHED

808
00:31:26,590 --> 00:31:29,493
BY WORLD RENOWNED PHOTOGRAPHER
GILLES BENSIMON,

809
00:31:29,493 --> 00:31:34,165
AND A $100,000 COVER GIRL
COSMETICS CONTRACT.

810
00:31:34,165 --> 00:31:37,434
NOW OF COURSE WE HAVE
SOME VERY OPINIONATED JUDGES--

811
00:31:37,434 --> 00:31:39,136
JANICE DICKINSON.

812
00:31:39,136 --> 00:31:42,339
JANICE IS THE FIRST SUPERMODEL
EVER IN EXISTENCE.

813
00:31:42,339 --> 00:31:44,608
NIGEL BARKER, WHO IS
A NOTED FASHION PHOTOGRAPHER.

814
00:31:44,608 --> 00:31:47,645
NOLÉ MARIN, A PROMINENT
FASHION EDITOR AND STYLIST,

815
00:31:47,645 --> 00:31:49,947
AND WE HAVE
OUR SPECIAL GUEST JUDGE--

816
00:31:49,947 --> 00:31:53,651
AN AMAZING DESIGNER,
MARC BOUWER.

817
00:31:53,651 --> 00:31:55,186
THIS WEEK
I TAUGHT YOU GUYS

818
00:31:55,186 --> 00:31:58,022
HOW TO PRESENT YOURSELF
AT GO-SEES.

819
00:31:58,022 --> 00:32:01,392
NOW IT'S TIME FOR THE JUDGES
TO SEE THAT FOR THEMSELVES.

820
00:32:01,392 --> 00:32:06,096
THE FIVE OF US HERE REPRESENT
A FICTITIOUS FASHION LINE

821
00:32:06,096 --> 00:32:08,632
BY THE NAME OF HOUSE
OF JE NE SAIS QUOI.

822
00:32:08,632 --> 00:32:11,902
WE WANT YOU TO TELL US

823
00:32:11,902 --> 00:32:15,105
WHY WE SHOULD HIRE YOU
TO BE OUR CAMPAIGN GIRL.

824
00:32:19,109 --> 00:32:20,878
Tyra: WELCOME TO
THE HOUSE OF...

825
00:32:20,878 --> 00:32:23,180
All: JE NE SE QUOI.

826
00:32:23,180 --> 00:32:25,082
Nigel: THIS IS A PIECE
FROM OUR LATEST COLLECTION

827
00:32:25,082 --> 00:32:27,084
- IN JE NE SE QUOI.
- Janice: (gasps)

828
00:32:27,084 --> 00:32:30,554
Nicole: THE GAS MASK MEETS
THE RUNWAY, AND I-I LOVE IT.

829
00:32:30,554 --> 00:32:31,555
Nigel: HOW DOES IT
MAKE YOU FEEL?

830
00:32:31,555 --> 00:32:33,257
Ann: IT MAKES ME
FEEL BEAUTIFUL

831
00:32:33,257 --> 00:32:35,125
AND KIND OF MYSTERIOUS.

832
00:32:35,125 --> 00:32:37,528
Norelle: AND IT'S SO UNIQUE
AND IT'S SUPER, LIKE, QUIRKY.

833
00:32:37,528 --> 00:32:39,029
Nigel: IS THIS SOMETHING
YOU'D LIKE TO WEAR?

834
00:32:39,029 --> 00:32:41,098
Eva: UM...

835
00:32:43,133 --> 00:32:44,668
I MEAN, IT WOULDN'T BE
MY EVERYDAY DRESS,

836
00:32:44,668 --> 00:32:46,103
BUT I WOULD
DEFINITELY ROCK IT.

837
00:32:46,103 --> 00:32:49,139
Janice: (French accent)
I SEE A BITTY BOUTON.

838
00:32:49,139 --> 00:32:51,508
DO YOU HAVE A LITTLE SKIN
PROBLEM? JUST A LITTLE?

839
00:32:51,508 --> 00:32:52,443
Yaya: IT'S
A MENSTRUAL BREAKOUT.

840
00:32:52,443 --> 00:32:54,545
Janice: AAH!

841
00:32:54,545 --> 00:32:58,482
Tyra: CASSIE, I WANT MY MUSE
TO LIVE INSIDE MY HOUSE WITH ME.

842
00:32:58,482 --> 00:33:01,285
Cassie: I WOULD BE HONORED
TO LIVE WITH YOU, OF COURSE.

843
00:33:01,285 --> 00:33:04,188
- Janice: WE ALL...
- All: LIVE TOGETHER.

844
00:33:04,188 --> 00:33:05,990
Ann: I FIND THAT--I MEAN,
I FIND THAT A LITTLE ODD,

845
00:33:05,990 --> 00:33:07,324
AND I'M NOT GONNA LIE
TO Y'ALL.

846
00:33:07,324 --> 00:33:10,261
Toccara: IF THIS CAMPAIGN IS
REALLY A BIG CAMPAIGN FOR YOU,

847
00:33:10,261 --> 00:33:12,529
WHY NOT MAKE IT
LARGER THAN LIFE?

848
00:33:12,529 --> 00:33:15,065
Janice: I CAN SEE WITH YOU
IT WOULD BE LARGER THAN LIFE.

849
00:33:23,907 --> 00:33:26,110
Tyra: NOW IT'S TIME
FOR YOUR EVALUATIONS.

850
00:33:26,110 --> 00:33:29,046
SO THE FIRST GIRL
ON THE CHOPPING BLOCK IS EVA.

851
00:33:29,046 --> 00:33:31,649
YOU HAD A PHOTO
WHERE YOU HAD TO EVOKE

852
00:33:31,649 --> 00:33:33,617
THE POWER OF AN ALTER EGO.

853
00:33:33,617 --> 00:33:35,219
Tyra: THAT'S ADORABLE.

854
00:33:35,219 --> 00:33:36,887
- Marc: WOW, THAT'S AMAZING.
- Nolé: IT IS REALLY AMAZING.

855
00:33:36,887 --> 00:33:38,022
Marc: IT TOOK ME
A WHILE TO REALIZE

856
00:33:38,022 --> 00:33:40,391
THAT IT WAS YOU
IN BOTH POSES.

857
00:33:40,391 --> 00:33:43,093
Janice: FINALLY YOU DIDN'T
TILT YOUR CHIN THAT FAR UP

858
00:33:43,093 --> 00:33:44,595
SO WE CAN SEE
RIGHT UP YOUR NOSTRILS.

859
00:33:44,595 --> 00:33:46,096
Tyra:
UP NEXT, WE HAVE ANN.

860
00:33:46,096 --> 00:33:47,531
- Janice: HELLO.
- Nigel: OOH.

861
00:33:47,531 --> 00:33:50,601
Marc: I JUST SEE SUCH
AMAZING POTENTIAL IN YOU,

862
00:33:50,601 --> 00:33:52,970
AND I THINK THAT PHOTOGRAPH
IS JUST THE BEGINNING.

863
00:33:52,970 --> 00:33:54,471
- Ann: THANK YOU.
- Tyra: ALL RIGHTY, CASSIE.

864
00:33:54,471 --> 00:33:57,141
SO YOU HAD A CASTING
FOR THE HOUSE OF JE NE SE QUOI.

865
00:33:57,141 --> 00:33:59,176
I SAID BLAH.

866
00:33:59,176 --> 00:34:00,544
Nigel: I KNOW THAT
WE WERE LAUGHING,

867
00:34:00,544 --> 00:34:01,645
WE WERE HAVING FUN WITH IT.

868
00:34:01,645 --> 00:34:05,282
YOU HAVE TO BE HAPPY,
POLITE, NON-FAZED BY THAT.

869
00:34:05,282 --> 00:34:06,283
Tyra:
ALL RIGHT, CASSIE, SO YOU HAD

870
00:34:06,283 --> 00:34:07,885
AN ALTER EGO PHOTO SHOOT

871
00:34:07,885 --> 00:34:09,053
WHERE YOU HAD TO SHOW
SOME STRENGTH.

872
00:34:10,420 --> 00:34:12,255
- IT COULD BE STRONGER.
- Janice: EXACTLY.

873
00:34:12,255 --> 00:34:14,958
EVEN IF YOU TOOK YOUR HANDS UP
AND DID DIVA.

874
00:34:14,958 --> 00:34:16,427
Tyra: THE MAKEUP IS FIERCE,
THE HAIR IS FIERCE,

875
00:34:16,427 --> 00:34:18,594
BUT YOUR FACE IS
A LITTLE BIT TOO RELAXED.

876
00:34:18,594 --> 00:34:20,197
YOU'RE, LIKE,
KIND OF PUSHING THROUGH,

877
00:34:20,197 --> 00:34:21,264
BUT NOT BURSTING THROUGH.

878
00:34:21,264 --> 00:34:22,565
Nigel: JUST REALIZE
HOW GORGEOUS YOU ARE

879
00:34:22,565 --> 00:34:24,268
AND BE FULL OF YOURSELF,
STRONG.

880
00:34:24,268 --> 00:34:25,436
- Cassie: THANK YOU.
- Janice: BYE-BYE.

881
00:34:25,436 --> 00:34:26,637
Tyra: AMANDA.

882
00:34:32,342 --> 00:34:34,578
YEAH. IT'S SAD WHEN
THE JUDGES ARE JUST SILENT.

883
00:34:34,578 --> 00:34:36,013
THAT MEANS IT'S BAD.

884
00:34:36,013 --> 00:34:37,313
Nolé: THE WAY
YOU'RE HOLDING YOUR MOUTH

885
00:34:37,313 --> 00:34:38,415
HAS NO FEELING TO ME.

886
00:34:38,415 --> 00:34:40,951
Nigel: WE KNOW YOU'VE GOT
THAT CAPACITY TO PULL OUT

887
00:34:40,951 --> 00:34:42,119
KILLER PICTURES
WITH YOUR EYES,

888
00:34:42,119 --> 00:34:44,288
AND THE WHOLE THING,
IT JUST SEEMS LIKE, UH...

889
00:34:45,456 --> 00:34:47,024
Tyra: UP NEXT, NORELLE.

890
00:34:47,024 --> 00:34:49,126
Marc: I'D LIKE YOU TO DEVELOP
A LITTLE MORE CONFIDENCE.

891
00:34:49,126 --> 00:34:50,194
I WANNA SEE SOME SPARK.

892
00:34:50,194 --> 00:34:51,895
I WANNA SEE "I'M NORELLE."

893
00:34:51,895 --> 00:34:53,130
Tyra: I WANT YOU
TO TRY SOMETHING.

894
00:34:53,130 --> 00:34:54,431
I WANT YOU TO PUT
ONE OF YOUR HANDS ON YOUR HIP

895
00:34:54,431 --> 00:34:57,134
AND KIND OF, LIKE, GO--

896
00:34:57,134 --> 00:34:58,235
Norelle: WELL,
I'D PROBABLY DO THIS ONE.

897
00:34:58,235 --> 00:34:59,236
Tyra: THAT LOOKS BETTER.

898
00:34:59,236 --> 00:35:01,438
THERE'S CONFIDENCE NOW
INSTEAD OF "HI."

899
00:35:01,438 --> 00:35:02,539
Janice: OH, MY GOD.

900
00:35:02,539 --> 00:35:03,741
Nigel: WHOA.

901
00:35:03,741 --> 00:35:05,309
Marc: THE SECRETARY LOOK
IS NOT WORKING FOR YOU.

902
00:35:05,309 --> 00:35:06,677
Janice: NO, NOT AT ALL.

903
00:35:06,677 --> 00:35:09,380
- THAT WORKS.
- Tyra: GORGEOUS!

904
00:35:09,380 --> 00:35:10,414
Nigel: IT'S ALMOST
AS IF YOU HAVE TO BE

905
00:35:10,414 --> 00:35:13,217
DRESSED UP IN COSTUME
TO BECOME FIERCE.

906
00:35:13,217 --> 00:35:14,251
Tyra: YAYA.

907
00:35:14,251 --> 00:35:15,352
OH, THAT'S
THE PRETTIEST POSE.

908
00:35:15,352 --> 00:35:16,954
- Janice: THAT'S FIERCE.
- Tyra: YEAH.

909
00:35:16,954 --> 00:35:18,188
Yaya:
HARD TO SEE IT. WOW.

910
00:35:18,188 --> 00:35:19,223
Tyra: SHE'S A GHOST.

911
00:35:19,223 --> 00:35:21,058
THAT'S YOUR WEAKEST
PICTURE YET.

912
00:35:21,058 --> 00:35:22,292
Janice: IT IS WEAK.

913
00:35:22,292 --> 00:35:24,361
Tyra: YEAH, THAT DOESN'T
LOOK LIKE A MODEL TO ME.

914
00:35:24,361 --> 00:35:25,929
NICOLE.

915
00:35:25,929 --> 00:35:27,631
Janice: PROM,
DEBUTANTE, COCKTAIL.

916
00:35:27,631 --> 00:35:29,032
Nolé: NOT GOOD.

917
00:35:29,032 --> 00:35:29,933
Nigel: WE KNOW YOU COULD DO
BETTER THAN THAT.

918
00:35:29,933 --> 00:35:31,168
Janice: EVERYTHING
ABOUT IT'S WRONG.

919
00:35:31,168 --> 00:35:32,169
Nicole: OKAY.

920
00:35:32,169 --> 00:35:33,237
Tyra:
NEXT WE HAVE TOCCARA.

921
00:35:33,237 --> 00:35:35,172
Janice: HAVE YOU EVER
IN HISTORY SEEN ANYONE

922
00:35:35,172 --> 00:35:36,473
WALK DOWN THE RUNWAY
LIKE THAT?

923
00:35:36,473 --> 00:35:38,108
Tyra: I THINK
THAT YOU'RE THE TYPE OF GIRL

924
00:35:38,108 --> 00:35:40,978
THAT CAN HANDLE THIS CRAZY ASS
FASHION INDUSTRY

925
00:35:40,978 --> 00:35:43,313
'CAUSE THERE ARE
SOME CRAZY FOOLS UP IN HERE.

926
00:35:43,313 --> 00:35:46,950
THIS HOUSE OF JE NE SE QUOI
IS ONLY A LITTLE TASTE.

927
00:35:46,950 --> 00:35:48,218
IN YOUR MIND,
I'M SURE YOU WERE LIKE,

928
00:35:48,218 --> 00:35:50,654
"THEY'RE CRAZY. THEY'RE CRAZY,
BUT THEY WANT THIS,

929
00:35:50,654 --> 00:35:52,623
AND I'M-A GIVE IT TO 'EM."
YOU KNOW?

930
00:35:52,623 --> 00:35:55,559
BUT, HEY, I WAS LIKE,
"SHE'S FANTABULOUS."

931
00:35:57,094 --> 00:35:58,595
Janice: THERE'S NOTHING
MODELLY ABOUT IT. NEXT.

932
00:35:58,595 --> 00:36:00,063
Nolé: IT'S A PRETTY SHOT,

933
00:36:00,063 --> 00:36:02,266
BUT IT NEEDS TO HAVE MORE
PASSION BEHIND THE EYES.

934
00:36:02,266 --> 00:36:04,101
IT ALWAYS GOES
BACK TO THE EYES FOR ME.

935
00:36:04,101 --> 00:36:05,669
Janice: THIS IS NOT
VERSATILE ENOUGH

936
00:36:05,669 --> 00:36:07,304
TO BE TOP MODEL.

937
00:36:07,304 --> 00:36:09,006
- IT'S JUST NOT. I'M SO SORRY.
- Nigel: NO. I AGREE WITH YOU.

938
00:36:10,340 --> 00:36:11,508
Tyra: THAT IS
ABSOLUTELY GORGEOUS.

939
00:36:11,508 --> 00:36:12,509
YOU'RE GIVIN' IT.

940
00:36:12,509 --> 00:36:14,278
Nolé: GLAMOUR, DARLING.

941
00:36:14,278 --> 00:36:17,014
I WANNA BE PLATINUM, TOO.

942
00:36:17,014 --> 00:36:18,949
Tyra: NOW IT'S TIME
TO DELIBERATE.

943
00:36:18,949 --> 00:36:20,584
YAYA.
DO YOU WANNA START?

944
00:36:20,584 --> 00:36:22,619
Janice:
I'M PULLING FOR YAYA.

945
00:36:22,619 --> 00:36:25,422
Nolé: IN THIS PHOTO,
HALF OF IT IS AMAZING.

946
00:36:25,422 --> 00:36:27,257
THE OTHER HALF,
SHE DIDN'T NAIL IT.

947
00:36:27,257 --> 00:36:29,259
Tyra: ANN.

948
00:36:29,259 --> 00:36:32,362
Marc: I HAVE SEEN THE STARTS
OF MANY GREAT MODELS.

949
00:36:32,362 --> 00:36:34,164
ANN HAS THAT.

950
00:36:34,164 --> 00:36:36,266
Tyra: THIS PICTURE
IS REALLY STRONG.

951
00:36:36,266 --> 00:36:38,368
Nigel: ANN HAS REALLY UPPED
THE ANTE THIS WEEK FOR HERSELF.

952
00:36:38,368 --> 00:36:39,369
Tyra: NICOLE.

953
00:36:39,369 --> 00:36:41,071
Nolé: SHE HAS
AN INCREDIBLE FACE.

954
00:36:41,071 --> 00:36:42,306
Tyra: I DON'T KNOW
ANYTHING ABOUT HER.

955
00:36:42,306 --> 00:36:44,174
SHE SMILES
AND SHE'S KIND OF CUTE,

956
00:36:44,174 --> 00:36:45,409
BUT THEN SHE WALKS OUT AND
I'M LIKE, "WHO WAS THAT?"

957
00:36:45,409 --> 00:36:46,910
AMANDA.

958
00:36:46,910 --> 00:36:48,145
Nigel: I THINK THIS IS
THE WORST PICTURES

959
00:36:48,145 --> 00:36:49,980
THAT SHE'S TAKEN,
FOR ME, ANYWAY.

960
00:36:49,980 --> 00:36:52,983
Marc: IF AMANDA BUILDS
A REALLY STRONG EDITORIAL BOOK,

961
00:36:52,983 --> 00:36:55,118
SHE CAN DEFINITELY HAVE
A SUCCESSFUL CAREER IN FASHION.

962
00:36:55,118 --> 00:36:56,119
Tyra: NORELLE.

963
00:36:56,119 --> 00:36:57,387
Nolé: I'VE NEVER BEEN
A BIG FAN OF NORELLE'S,

964
00:36:57,387 --> 00:36:59,590
BUT SHE HAS GROWN ON ME.

965
00:36:59,590 --> 00:37:02,459
Janice: NORELLE'S WALK
BELONGS IN A CIRCUS.

966
00:37:02,459 --> 00:37:06,330
Tyra: NORELLE IS PROGRESSING,
BUT HER PACE IS WAY TOO SLOW.

967
00:37:06,330 --> 00:37:07,331
EVA.

968
00:37:07,331 --> 00:37:09,366
Nigel: EVA REALLY
SHINES THIS WEEK.

969
00:37:09,366 --> 00:37:10,634
I MEAN, SHE NAILED IT.

970
00:37:10,634 --> 00:37:11,635
Janice:
EVA'S STILL SHORT.

971
00:37:11,635 --> 00:37:13,270
Nigel: PERHAPS SHE'LL GROW
BY NEXT WEEK.

972
00:37:13,270 --> 00:37:14,404
Tyra: TOCCARA.

973
00:37:14,404 --> 00:37:16,607
Nolé: SHE IS
A POWERFUL INDIVIDUAL,

974
00:37:16,607 --> 00:37:19,076
AND IN THIS SHOT, I DON'T THINK
THE PASSION WAS THERE.

975
00:37:19,076 --> 00:37:21,178
Nigel: THIS IS A LITTLE WEAK
ON ONE SIDE OF THE PICTURE.

976
00:37:21,178 --> 00:37:22,212
Janice: A LITTLE WEAK?

977
00:37:22,212 --> 00:37:23,580
THE CAR LOOKS BETTER
THAN SHE DOES.

978
00:37:23,580 --> 00:37:27,384
IF THE BODY COULD JUST
SLIM DOWN 150 POUNDS,

979
00:37:27,384 --> 00:37:28,585
THAT WOULD BE GOOD.

980
00:37:28,585 --> 00:37:29,887
Tyra: THEN SHE'D BE
30 POUNDS.

981
00:37:29,887 --> 00:37:31,088
Janice:
THAT WOULD BE BETTER.

982
00:37:31,088 --> 00:37:32,389
Marc: SHE'S NOT
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

983
00:37:32,389 --> 00:37:33,991
IT'S LUDICROUS TO THINK
THAT SHE WOULD BE.

984
00:37:33,991 --> 00:37:36,059
Janice: IT WILL
NEVER BE TOP MODEL.

985
00:37:36,059 --> 00:37:37,261
Tyra: THE THINGS
THAT YOU GUYS SAY

986
00:37:37,261 --> 00:37:39,630
ARE THE SAME THINGS
PEOPLE SAID ABOUT KATE MOSS.

987
00:37:39,630 --> 00:37:41,031
"SHE'S SO SHORT."

988
00:37:41,031 --> 00:37:43,100
"WE'VE NEVER HAD
A TOP MODEL THAT TINY."

989
00:37:43,100 --> 00:37:44,968
- Marc: TOCCARA IS OUT.
- Nigel: TOCCARA IS IN.

990
00:37:44,968 --> 00:37:45,969
Tyra: CASSIE.

991
00:37:45,969 --> 00:37:48,272
Nolé: I LOVE THE POSE,
BUT YOU KNOW WHAT?

992
00:37:48,272 --> 00:37:49,973
IN FASHION YOU HAVE TO WORK
WITH SOMEONE ALL DAY LONG,

993
00:37:49,973 --> 00:37:51,475
YOU HAVE TO BE
PASSIONATE ABOUT THEM.

994
00:37:51,475 --> 00:37:52,609
I WOULD NOT
BOOK THIS GIRL.

995
00:37:52,609 --> 00:37:54,912
Tyra: BUT CASSIE'S FACE
IS UNDENIABLE.

996
00:37:54,912 --> 00:37:56,179
I JUST WANT HER
TO WANNA BE HERE.

997
00:37:56,179 --> 00:37:58,482
Nigel: SHE NEEDS
TO REALIZE HOW PRETTY SHE IS

998
00:37:58,482 --> 00:37:59,483
AND SORT OF TURN IT OUT,

999
00:37:59,483 --> 00:38:01,251
BUT I'M NOT SURE
THAT SHE HAS THAT CAPACITY.

1000
00:38:01,251 --> 00:38:02,519
I'M AFRAID CASSIE'S OUT.

1001
00:38:02,519 --> 00:38:04,187
Janice:
CASSIE OVER TOCCARA?

1002
00:38:04,187 --> 00:38:06,323
Marc: CASSIE HAS
MUCH MORE POTENTIAL

1003
00:38:06,323 --> 00:38:07,925
TO BE A SUCCESSFUL MODEL
THAN TOCCARA HAS.

1004
00:38:07,925 --> 00:38:09,192
Nigel: CASSIE--

1005
00:38:09,192 --> 00:38:12,129
THIS KIND OF PRETTINESS
IN A GIRL IS A DIME A DOZEN.

1006
00:38:12,129 --> 00:38:14,131
TOCCARA--THERE'S JUST
SOMETHING ABOUT HER.

1007
00:38:14,131 --> 00:38:16,166
- SHE'S INTERESTING.
- Janice: YEAH, A LOT OF FLESH.

1008
00:38:16,166 --> 00:38:17,167
Tyra: YOU COULD HAVE VOTED HER
OUT THE FIRST WEEK.

1009
00:38:17,167 --> 00:38:18,468
- WHY WASTE HER TIME?
- Janice: DIDN'T I?

1010
00:38:18,468 --> 00:38:20,203
Tyra: NO, YOU DIDN'T.
WHY WASTE HER TIME

1011
00:38:20,203 --> 00:38:22,506
AND TELL HER THAT SHE COULD
BE THE ONLY GIRL

1012
00:38:22,506 --> 00:38:24,174
THAT COULD EVER WIN
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"

1013
00:38:24,174 --> 00:38:25,442
THAT'S A PLUS SIZE?

1014
00:38:25,442 --> 00:38:27,177
Janice: YOU'RE
THE FIRST PLUS-SIZED GIRL

1015
00:38:27,177 --> 00:38:29,046
THAT I COULD SAY
COULD MAKE IT.

1016
00:38:29,046 --> 00:38:30,147
Tyra: IT'S FINE
TO HAVE A STANCE,

1017
00:38:30,147 --> 00:38:31,448
BUT FOR YOU TO SAY
ONE THING

1018
00:38:31,448 --> 00:38:34,151
AND THEN SAY SOMETHING
THE NEXT--STICK WITH IT.

1019
00:38:34,151 --> 00:38:35,352
Janice:
I GIVE UP. I JUST--

1020
00:38:35,352 --> 00:38:36,920
Tyra: I JUST SEE A LOT
OF DISCRIMINATION.

1021
00:38:41,058 --> 00:38:42,859
Tyra: I HAVE
EIGHT BEAUTIFUL GIRLS

1022
00:38:42,859 --> 00:38:45,095
STANDING BEFORE ME,

1023
00:38:45,095 --> 00:38:48,932
BUT I ONLY HAVE SEVEN PHOTOS
IN MY HANDS.

1024
00:38:48,932 --> 00:38:50,834
THESE PHOTOS
REPRESENT THE SEVEN OF YOU

1025
00:38:50,834 --> 00:38:53,136
THAT WILL CONTINUE
ON THE JOURNEY

1026
00:38:53,136 --> 00:38:55,606
TOWARDS BECOMING
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1027
00:38:55,606 --> 00:38:58,542
THE FIRST NAME
I'M GOING TO CALL...

1028
00:39:00,577 --> 00:39:01,678
EVA.

1029
00:39:03,380 --> 00:39:05,682
EVA, THIS PICTURE
IS TO DIE FOR.

1030
00:39:05,682 --> 00:39:07,017
CONGRATULATIONS.

1031
00:39:07,017 --> 00:39:08,285
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1032
00:39:08,285 --> 00:39:09,152
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1033
00:39:09,152 --> 00:39:11,221
Eva: THANK YOU.

1034
00:39:11,221 --> 00:39:12,723
Tyra: ANN.

1035
00:39:14,925 --> 00:39:16,259
WHAT HAPPENED TO THE GIRL

1036
00:39:16,259 --> 00:39:17,628
THAT DIDN'T KNOW
HOW TO TAKE PICTURES?

1037
00:39:17,628 --> 00:39:18,629
Ann: I DON'T KNOW.

1038
00:39:18,629 --> 00:39:19,863
Tyra:
I THINK YOU'VE SHOWN US

1039
00:39:19,863 --> 00:39:21,965
THAT THERE IS A LITTLE
SOMETHING IN YOU,

1040
00:39:21,965 --> 00:39:24,067
ALITTLE SOMETHING
EXTRA SPECIAL.

1041
00:39:24,067 --> 00:39:25,102
CONGRATULATIONS.

1042
00:39:25,102 --> 00:39:27,204
YAYA.
CONGRATULATIONS.

1043
00:39:27,204 --> 00:39:28,238
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1044
00:39:28,238 --> 00:39:29,640
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1045
00:39:29,640 --> 00:39:30,774
NORELLE.

1046
00:39:30,774 --> 00:39:32,275
WHEN YOU'VE GOT
AN ELABORATE COSTUME ON,

1047
00:39:32,275 --> 00:39:33,944
GIRL, YOU'RE FIERCE.

1048
00:39:33,944 --> 00:39:35,612
BUT WHEN THE MAKEUP
IS ALL SIMPLE,

1049
00:39:35,612 --> 00:39:38,015
YOUR CONFIDENCE
JUST DISAPPEARS.

1050
00:39:38,015 --> 00:39:40,150
A TOP MODEL HAS TO USE
THEIR IMAGINATION.

1051
00:39:40,150 --> 00:39:41,785
CONGRATULATIONS.

1052
00:39:41,785 --> 00:39:43,186
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1053
00:39:43,186 --> 00:39:44,187
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1054
00:39:44,187 --> 00:39:45,322
Norelle: THANK YOU.

1055
00:39:45,322 --> 00:39:47,658
Tyra: AMANDA.

1056
00:39:47,658 --> 00:39:49,192
- CONGRATULATIONS.
- Amanda: THANK YOU.

1057
00:39:49,192 --> 00:39:51,928
Tyra: THE NEXT NAME
I'M GOING TO CALL--

1058
00:39:51,928 --> 00:39:52,829
NICOLE.

1059
00:39:56,266 --> 00:39:57,668
CONGRATULATIONS.

1060
00:39:57,668 --> 00:39:58,568
Nicole: THANK YOU.

1061
00:40:00,671 --> 00:40:03,173
Tyra: WILL TOCCARA AND CASSIE
PLEASE STEP FORWARD?

1062
00:40:04,608 --> 00:40:06,309
I ONLY HAVE ONE PHOTO
IN MY HANDS,

1063
00:40:06,309 --> 00:40:08,879
AND I WILL ONLY
CALL ONE NAME.

1064
00:40:08,879 --> 00:40:10,547
THE GIRL THAT I DO NOT CALL

1065
00:40:10,547 --> 00:40:12,949
MUST IMMEDIATELY
RETURN TO THE APARTMENT,

1066
00:40:12,949 --> 00:40:15,652
PACK YOUR BELONGINGS,
AND LEAVE.

1067
00:40:17,888 --> 00:40:19,756
ONE OF YOU SEEMS
TO HAVE SUCH JOY

1068
00:40:19,756 --> 00:40:23,927
AND SUCH A VIVACIOUS
AND CONTAGIOUS PERSONALITY.

1069
00:40:23,927 --> 00:40:26,196
THE OTHER DOESN'T SEEM LIKE
THEY WANNA BE HERE AT ALL.

1070
00:40:26,196 --> 00:40:29,933
ONE OF YOU A LOT OF THE JUDGES
REALLY BELIEVE IN

1071
00:40:29,933 --> 00:40:31,768
AND THINKS THAT, "EVEN THOUGH
SHE MIGHT NOT WANNA BE HERE,

1072
00:40:31,768 --> 00:40:33,603
SHE COULD HAVE A CRACK
AT BEING A MODEL."

1073
00:40:33,603 --> 00:40:35,772
AND THE OTHER
A LOT OF JUDGES THINK,

1074
00:40:35,772 --> 00:40:37,140
"THERE'S NO PLACE FOR HER
IN THIS INDUSTRY.

1075
00:40:37,140 --> 00:40:38,275
IT'S NOT GONNA CHANGE.

1076
00:40:38,275 --> 00:40:39,676
THIS IS THE WAY IT IS

1077
00:40:39,676 --> 00:40:41,211
AND THIS IS THE WAY
IT'S ALWAYS BEEN."

1078
00:40:41,211 --> 00:40:43,680
TONIGHT'S JUDGING
WAS VERY DIFFICULT.

1079
00:40:51,588 --> 00:40:53,090
Tyra: TOCCARA,
CONGRATULATIONS.

1080
00:40:55,592 --> 00:40:56,893
YOU'RE STILL IN THE RUNNING
TOWARDS BECOMING

1081
00:40:56,893 --> 00:40:58,195
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1082
00:40:58,195 --> 00:41:00,797
Toccara: THANK YOU.
THANK YOU.

1083
00:41:00,797 --> 00:41:01,732
Tyra: THANKS, CASSIE.

1084
00:41:14,978 --> 00:41:16,947
Cassie: I JUST HAD
A FEELING IT WOULD BE ME

1085
00:41:16,947 --> 00:41:18,749
JUST BECAUSE
I WAS UNHAPPY HERE.

1086
00:41:18,749 --> 00:41:20,717
I DON'T WANNA LIVE
IN NEW YORK CITY

1087
00:41:20,717 --> 00:41:22,285
BECAUSE I DON'T THINK
I HAVE WHAT IT TAKES

1088
00:41:22,285 --> 00:41:23,887
TO BE A TOP MODEL.

1089
00:41:23,887 --> 00:41:25,956
I FEEL LIKE I'M JUST WITH
GIRLS I DON'T LIKE.

1090
00:41:25,956 --> 00:41:28,592
I JUST WANNA BE WITH
MY BOYFRIEND AND MY MOM.

1091
00:41:28,592 --> 00:41:31,261
I DON'T EVER WANNA LIVE WITH
A GROUP OF GIRLS AGAIN.

1092
00:41:31,261 --> 00:41:33,163
LET'S GO TO OKLAHOMA.

1093
00:41:48,301 --> 00:41:53,473
Tyra: STAY TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM OUR NEXT EPISODE.

1094
00:41:53,473 --> 00:41:56,209
HERE'S WHAT'S COMIN' UP ON
"AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL"...

1095
00:41:56,209 --> 00:41:58,778
Ann: TO THE SEVENS.

1096
00:41:58,778 --> 00:42:00,113
Tyra: THE COMPETITION
HEATS UP.

1097
00:42:00,113 --> 00:42:01,714
Men: YAYA! YAYA!

1098
00:42:01,714 --> 00:42:02,448
Tyra: AND THE GIRLS
GET IN TOUCH

1099
00:42:02,448 --> 00:42:04,150
WITH THEIR INNER DIVAS.

1100
00:42:04,150 --> 00:42:06,085
Woman: WHO'S THE MOST
ANNOYING GIRL IN THE GROUP?

1101
00:42:06,085 --> 00:42:07,453
Eva: EVERYONE'S
EQUALLY ANNOYING.

1102
00:42:09,088 --> 00:42:11,891
Tyra: AND AT THE PHOTO SHOOT
